Package: crikey
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/crikey-launcher/crikey
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libvulkan1 | libegl1
Description: Fast, keyboard-driven application launcher
 CriKey finds and runs applications, files and plugin commands from a single
 keyboard-driven prompt. Plugins run as supervised subprocesses, so a slow or
 crashing plugin cannot stall the launcher.
 .
 Plugins written in Python need an interpreter: this package depends on the
 distribution's python3 unless it was built with a bundled runtime, in which
 case the interpreter ships inside /usr/lib/crikey and the dependency is
 dropped.
